{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f7cdcfa29a6c53bfe3382c7d204f0b6eecd51e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{-1} + b^{-1}}{(a+b)^{-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"81\" height=\"45\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40e647836f708be8822338d94383b6e6864483db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad \\frac{(a+b)^2}{ab} \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad \\frac{1}{ab} \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad ab \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad \\frac{ab}{(a+b)^2} \\quad \\text{(E)} a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"466\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/6/de63d919410c5c97a1adbfd2fa18a68ecd0cacfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b}}{\\frac{1}{a+b}} = \\frac{\\frac{a+b}{ab}}{\\frac{1}{a+b}} = \\frac{a+b}{ab} \\cdot (a+b) = \\boxed{\\text{(A)} \\quad \\frac{(a+b)^2}{ab}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"381\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_7\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 7\"> Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_9\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041715\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 657/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 301/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 870/5000000 byte